  SDL3        Copyright (C) 1997-2026 Sam Lantinga                         zlib licence
  SQLite      public domain
  Lua         Copyright (C) 1994-2026 Lua.org, PUC-Rio                     MIT licence
  zlib        Copyright (C) 1995-2026 Jean-loup Gailly and Mark Adler      zlib licence
  stb         Sean Barrett and contributors                               public domain or MIT
  miniaudio   David Reid                                                  public domain or MIT-0
  Vulkan      The Khronos Group Inc. (its headers; no library is passed on)  Apache-2.0 or MIT

PHI's repository has what PHI needs to call each (written from its headers) and its
licence; the libraries themselves are fetched from their makers by vendor/fetch.py, and a
release has them in place.
